  "description": "The AlgFormer/HoloFormer production standard: a stamped, append-only lineage journal that answers \"what was true when this happened\" without ever re-deriving history from current state, the canonical confidence-gated decode policy PrismStudio actually runs (resonance-floor or nucleus sampling, with a degeneracy guard), and a growth surface (Prism.Growth) that grows context/layers/shifts/vocab correctly by construction and stamps the lineage journal automatically as it goes. Built to stop the same class of bug that has hit the hot path three times (alpha recomputed from a live constant, a regrow boundary invented from a schedule, a serve depth read from the wrong knob) by making \"derive from stamped history, never from ambient state\" the one thing this package does.",
